cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "LIBRA-Eval & META-RAG: Metadata-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Library Discovery"
abstract: >-
  A metadata-aware RAG system for library discovery (META-RAG) and a two-sided
  benchmark (LIBRA-Eval) with 8,690 discovery questions (1,076 evaluated
  in-corpus) and 600 cataloging records. Shows retrieval quality is bounded by
  metadata quality: metadata-aware retrieval improves topical discovery
  nDCG@10 from 0.465 to 0.691 (p<0.001) over the full in-corpus pool of 227
  books.
type: software
